<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT PAKISTAN BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT PAKISTAN BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Pakistan by seven wickets in their limited overs World Series match at Adelaide Oval on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores - Pakistan 176 all out in 48.4 overs; West Indies 177 for three in 36.1 overs (Junior Murray 86).</p>
</text>
